    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like im just in \"survival mode\" though. it feels more like i am a ghost. like im just taking up space that i dont even belong in. sometimes i think maybe im not even really here. if nobody sees me or needs me, why am i even bothering to keep going through the motions every day?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
